tch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds the Lottes tone mapper as described in this GDC talk here\r\nhttps://www.gdcvault.com/play/1023512/Advanced-Graphics-Techniques-Tutorial-Day\r\n\r\nVisually, similar to AGX, though a tad bit more contrasty / punchy. Does a good job at maintaining detail in midtones and highlights, without a lot of color hue shifting, while being cheaper to calculate.\r\n\r\nScene taken from @Calinou's project from https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/7545\r\n\r\n\r\n**Reinhard**\r\n<img width=\"2968\" height=\"2198\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/127c613f-b2cd-4a12-9866-a365b6c438b8\" />\r\n\r\n**ACES**\r\n<img width=\"2968\" height=\"2188\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/253c7cc5-fedf-42aa-b082-cac057fef4d1\" />\r\n\r\n**AGX**\r\n<img width=\"2970\" height=\"2190\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cdb95c7-d6a9-4508-9853-2a8208713359\" />\r\n\r\n**Lottes**\r\n<img width=\"2968\" height=\"2196\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b85fe5d-ad7f-48c3-b252-c0315b1e9a0a\" />","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110190/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":6},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110190/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}